      "id": "code_go_text",
      "x": 140, "y": 1745,
      "width": 680, "height": 215,
      "text": "// Go — source of truth\n\ntype ShipControl struct {\n    DesiredX float32 `net:\"qvel\"`\n    DesiredY float32 `net:\"qvel\"`\n    Heading  float32 `net:\"qangle\"`\n    Boost    bool    `net:\"auto\"`\n}\n\nmmokit.KindComponent[ShipControl]()\nmmokit.KindComponent[component.Position]()",
      "originalText": "// Go — source of truth\n\ntype ShipControl struct {\n    DesiredX float32 `net:\"qvel\"`\n    DesiredY float32 `net:\"qvel\"`\n    Heading  float32 `net:\"qangle\"`\n    Boost    bool    `net:\"auto\"`\n}\n\nmmokit.KindComponent[ShipControl]()\nmmokit.KindComponent[component.Position]()",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3,
