      "x": 1760, "y": 1745,
      "width": 540, "height": 215,
      "text": "// TypeScript — generated SDK\n\nconst client = new MMOClient(ws);\n\nclient.onEntitySpawn(\"ship\", (e) => {\n  // fully typed; delta-decoded\n  e.shipControl.heading;  // float32\n  e.shipControl.boost;    // boolean\n  e.position.x;           // float32\n});\n\n// no hand-written codec",
      "originalText": "// TypeScript — generated SDK\n\nconst client = new MMOClient(ws);\n\nclient.onEntitySpawn(\"ship\", (e) => {\n  // fully typed; delta-decoded\n  e.shipControl.heading;  // float32\n  e.shipControl.boost;    // boolean\n  e.position.x;           // float32\n});\n\n// no hand-written codec",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3,
